<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Hotel California</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Joji</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Piss In The Wind</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0haXcqxsgfbGTq6OYjLyIs</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.442" end="00:14.083">Thought of you make my heart beat fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.083" end="00:16.698">Too soon and I'm way too attached</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.698" end="00:19.250">You the best that I ever had</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.250" end="00:21.895">This the first time I hope it lasts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.895" end="00:23.395" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.916" end="00:24.527">Kind of face that you can't unsee</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.527" end="00:27.153">Kind of love that you can't just leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.153" end="00:29.713">**** me up, got me up past three</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.713" end="00:33.793">But I love when it's just for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.793" end="00:35.293" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.814" end="00:39.091">She said, "Nice to meet ya, nice to know ya"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.091" end="00:44.408">And left me at the Hotel California</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.408" end="00:49.610">Don't know what it means, guess I'm a goner</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.610" end="00:57.610">Lost you in the waves, I'm underwater</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.074" end="01:03.645">Lost you in the waves, I'm underwater</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.645" end="01:05.145" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.666" end="01:06.250">Thought of you make my heart beat fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.250" end="01:08.877">Too soon and I'm way too attached</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.877" end="01:11.488">You the best that I ever had</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.488" end="01:13.437">This the first time I hope that it lasts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.437" end="01:14.937" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.458" end="01:18.664">Just when I think she's right where I want her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.664" end="01:22.931">Then she goes like a wave to the water</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.931" end="01:26.008">Then ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.008" end="01:27.508" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.029" end="01:31.224">She said, "Nice to meet ya, nice to know ya"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.224" end="01:36.579">And left me at the Hotel California</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.579" end="01:41.795">Don't know what it means, guess I'm a goner</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.795" end="01:49.795">Lost you in the waves, I'm underwater</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.249" end="02:00.249">Lost you in the waves, I'm underwater</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.673" end="02:06.673">Lost you in the waves, I'm underwater</p></div></body></tt>